14) UKRAINIAN PAROLEE

A UKRAINIAN NATIONAL, CITIZEN, OR SOMEONE WHO LAST HABITUALLY LIVED IN UKRAINE WHO IS GRANTED PAROLE BETWEEN FEBRUARY 24, 2022 AND SEPTEMBER 30, * 2024 IS ELIGBLE FOR BENEFITS WITHOUT A WAITING PERIOD. THESE INDIVIDUALS ARE EXEMPT FROM SPONSOR DEEMING REQUIREMENTS. THESE INDIVIDUALS ARE ELIGIBLE SO LONG AS THEY REMAIN IN PAROLE STATUS OR ANOTHER ELIGIBLE IMMIGRATION STATUS. THE SPOUSE AND CHILDREN OF SUCH INDIVIDUALS, AS WELL AS PARENTS, LEGAL GUARDIAN, AND PRIMARY CAREGIVERS OF SUCH INDIVIDUALS WHO WERE UNACCOMPANIED MINORS ARE ELIGIBLE EVEN IF THEY ARE GRANTED PAROLE AFTER SEPTEMBER 30, 2024 **.

